Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's waiting\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride\Naway, we're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun,\Nwhile our dreams are never-ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they gonna toss\Neveryone down here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, inside too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there! Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is this some kind of trash heap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there toys everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To think there was such a massive\Njunkyard hidden beneath the kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Them—excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I could be wrong if so,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,forgive me, but you're him, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you've been alive\Nall this time, King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,way You crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head\Nwhen you fell down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That old king lost his mind, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Went on a rampage and had to be put\Ndown like a wild dog, from what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're far enough from\Nprying eyes, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well shed my disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hide the truth from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am indeed Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Though there is no need to call\Nme king anymore, Captain Tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been alive this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even save my own granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a sad old man\Nnow, not worthy to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With no flamingo in control...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've been watching\Nover Viola all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that you would not\Nabandon your duty or honor so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how\Nmuch you've suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing compared\Nto what you've gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,he's not kidding it really is King
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick is that the king of Prudence none
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,other old friend so many times in the\Npast you've aided my kingdom oh I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you whoa there okay things haven't\Nbeen the same at all since you've been
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,away there's no stability between nations\Nthese days. War all the time. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Had had enough. Had enough. Why don't\Nyou wake up while you're crying? Someone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,else is laughing all the way to the\Nbank ever think of that our nations
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,are being pushed into war with each\Nother all to suit someone else's agenda
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a nice gig for a weapons dealer\Nthe more we fight the richer they get
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and in this case the one\Nto blame is a man known
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,as joker it's an alias\Nof doflamingo of course
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,as of yet we haven't determined where he
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,manufactures or stores his\Nweapons but we do know that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he's selling them to\Nour enemies locking our
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,kingdom into a war that\Nnever seems to end we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,entered this tournament\Nas an excuse to infiltrate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the city and search for\Ndoflamingo's factory at
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the bequest of the king\Nof kano we of the hapasui
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,army are working to\Nstem the tide of weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,smuggling that plagues\Nthis world king Rick
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,doflamingo's ascension to\Nthe throne is the result
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,of you acting foolishly\Nand now all the nations
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,around you are suffering\Nwhat he says is true
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,king elizabello it is noble\Nof you to show gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for the aidress Rosa\Noffered us in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But those days are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The name King Riku's been dragged\Nthrough the mud, and rightfully so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Dagama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We faced a nightmare ten years ago,\Nand the truth you know is a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So shut your mouth about King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:06:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, I was\Na soldier in your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, me too, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? What's\Nhappening? This is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they were broken,\Nbut now they're getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would all those soldiers bow to Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And the toys, too. What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought everyone here hated King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a structure down here\Neven King Rick didn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, we should\Nstart searching underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep me posted, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Calic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing to us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's jogging me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Baa-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Baa-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou shalt not harm any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou shalt obey all\Norders from the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You better follow those rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go straight through that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep walking, you'll find a\Nfactory with a port along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,March.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet and work hard out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, little minion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those contenders were all pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a long time before they break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to stop, but\Nmy body won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I can't disobey him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you turn me into?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of the shot, cabbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I watching the\Nmatch on this tiny screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go cheer for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, guys! See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, one last thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it seemed like everyone in the\Ncountry was happy and having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you guys showed me\Nhow things really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What you saw was a surface where winners\Nare living happy lives, not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Flamingo deems the\Npeople who follow him winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyone who disobeys him losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His attitude is no different\Nthan the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The rogues and renegades\Nare labeled as trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you sweep them out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your country starts looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on the surface at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure hunting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it kind of reminds me\Nof the country I grew up in,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,starts with a bad feeling, then you\Nstart noticing the darker truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling we've got even uglier\Nsurprises waiting for us out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You better keep your guard up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. I'll see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Many ages ago, our Tantata\Nancestors took to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in search of treasure, but in search\Nof resources that their homeland lacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But they could not hide from the big people,\Nand their encounters never ended well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, our race was\Nin danger of going extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, looky, the little people!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When all seemed lost, they came here\Nto dress Rosa and met with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He offered the tantara a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for a bit of labor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he would provide us with a\Nhome, resources, and safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for the king's\Nname, it was Don Quixote.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This fateful encounter occurred\Nmore than 900 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's remembered as the beginning\Nof the darkest age in our history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:11:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We call it the Slave Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some surviving\Nmanuscripts that detail the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,cruelty we faced at the\Nhands of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And they are horrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors toiled and toiled\Nunderground, hidden away from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the big people\Nabove lived a life of luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Built upon the backs of our efforts\Nwith the riches we discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the next hundred years\Nwere part of the blank century?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so the records from that\Ntime are lost to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But 800 years ago, a new king\Ncame to power in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,King, we do the prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon he learned the truth\Nof our people's sad history,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the centuries of oppression and slavery,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,then to our surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears streaming down his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he bowed his head and offered\Nus his deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, the king devised a plan to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He enacted reparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us we no longer\Nneeded to slave away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We could take anything we\Nrequired from the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And we didn't need to\Npay a thing in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My bag's missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has stolen my favorite jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All you can do is laugh and let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick declared that our\Nactions were the work of fairies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so the citizens accepted\Nthem with good humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The legend of the Dressrosa Fairies\Nwas born and continues to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this Rick guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the rule of the\Nbenevolent Rick dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,a helping hand was always lent to\Nneighboring countries when they were in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I can't say that the\Nkingdom was especially wealthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:14:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,its people were always smiling and\Nthe world thought of them warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors paid tribute\Nto King Rick by planting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,flowers and greenery over\Nthe whole countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a labor of love\Nthat continued until
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire kingdom\Nshimmered like a rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tantara are linked to\Nthe Rick family by a bond
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,of respect that's been\Nnourished for over 800 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But alas, those many years of\Nprosperity may be coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Don Quixote family has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Their descendant is king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo cares not\Nfor the Tantata tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He wishes to repeat our tragic history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First, he sees my daughter, Mon Cherie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that he's taken\N500 of our people hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt he'd\Nmake slaves of us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let him have his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall be forever free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And so we fight to oppose that\Ndespot from the Don Quixote
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,line to defend our fair kingdom\Nso everyone can live free!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have heroes on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Usalit will bring us victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Usalit! Usalit! Usalit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on your hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he awesome or what? Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gingory, you're such a stand-up guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even nice to these little bug people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you do against Robots?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, bugs. In a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no problem, Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One question? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that woman fighting\Nout there in the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowd seems to hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But judging by their jeers,\Nshe's related to the former king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something we don't\Nknow about the Rick dynasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick lost the support of his citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,in a sudden tragedy that struck one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought for his people until the\Nend, but that story has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Riku's entire family can go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens don't know what\Nreally happened that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to protect your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After he took control of the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo tried to erase\NKing Riku's bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I took Rebecca away and\Nwent into hiding with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, she was able to grow into adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we were discovered, and Doflamingo\Ndecided to put her on public display!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:17:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will restore the people's faith in King\NRick and I will protect Rebecca from harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I have to give my life to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why we fight to\Nput an end to this—who
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A soldier who couldn't complete his duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I let her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For as long as I live, I'll never\Nforget what happened that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But Rebecca has forgotten me\Nbecause I was turned into a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This toy soldier is brave and true,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,in the rain or in the snow\Nhe will stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is I'm Rebecca's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do the same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this—Rebecca's taking advantage\Nof Logan being distracted and flees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,flees
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's scurrying across\Nthe arena like a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And rolling low, didn't give it a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blowing down the other contenders\Nlike a field of daisies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you want to see one, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight back or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:19:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandpa tried to burn us down,\NRebecca, and now he's burning in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She really is King Riku's granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If what you say was true, hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you before you transformed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you're her father, and\Nher grandfather is the king...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything began on that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a prince or something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when I think about it,\Nthe signs came before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It truly began when a woman named\NMonet came to work at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the bird lady, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.44,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In only a decade, the whole\Nkingdom has been transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Its people as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Some pirates were starting a ruckus,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:20:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but the royal army ran them out so they\Ndidn't cause much damage in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.42,0:20:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My gosh, we've gone two weeks\Nwithout an inch of rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, still, the flowers never\Nwilt, even now. Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to the fairies, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how dry it gets, they\Nalways protect the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more! I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have strength enough\Nto shout, you won't starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how poor we might feel at\Ntimes, there's never war here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And peace is the most important\Nthing of all, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In 800 years of the Rick dynasty, never\Nonce was Dressrosa embroiled in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, that is remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, almost a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Until our peace was destroyed by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly he descended upon the palace,\Ndancing in the darkness like a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Don Quixote do Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.86,0:21:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard troubling tales of a pirate\Nnamed Don Quixote wreaking havoc nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you were right to be troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Though that's only the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know my ancestors, the Don\NQuixote family, once ruled this kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you've forgotten, I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I've returned to\Ntake my place as your king!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know about the havoc you\Nwreaked by stealing heavenly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,tributes before they could\Nreach the Celestial Dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and how you became a warlord\Nby blackmailing the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.86,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor saps don't know what to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't threaten someone who's not\Nafraid of the Celestial Dragons, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, since you know what I'm\Nabout, let's cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sell you this kingdom\Nfor, say, ten billion berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd sell me my own kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As a courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.90,0:22:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I could also take it by force if\Nyou don't want to accept my offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To avoid bloodshed, I would happily pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But ten billion berries\Nis far more than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have until sunrise, so I'd get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get outside help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is to test your worth as a king,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and you can't tell your\Npeople about me or our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like your\Nodds, then fight me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll warn you: even if\Nyou win, it won't be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people will be bathed in carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose well, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.90,0:22:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The man is a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A war would be justified, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.60,0:23:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough fighting to kill is not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We must never lose sight of\Nwhat it means to be human,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but sir, we could never\Ncollect that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Few of our citizens are wealthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.02,0:23:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one has nearly that much\Nbesides the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandoned Dress Rosa, our kingdom\Nhas not engaged in war in 800 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That fact is proof of our humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow it. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Split up and lead to different villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Collect the 10 billion\Nfrom all over the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't, the Threlso\Nwill be ruled by pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear this won't be pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,lose the trust of our citizens when we\Ndemand their money, but bear it till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When everything is settled, I will do\Neverything in my power to make it up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.60,0:23:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only We can't use\Ntrickery to get out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:24:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last berry counts—the fate of our\Nnation is resting on your shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,in the army, it's awfully late!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.44,0:24:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.35,0:24:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,need you to fight every last berry in\Ntown and bring them here immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.70,0:24:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.42,0:24:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think the king is\Ngoing to say when he hears of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.74,0:24:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here on orders from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.21,0:24:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time left\Nto explain. Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith in King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.44,0:24:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask questions and bring the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.92,0:24:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.24,0:24:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.98,0:24:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.12,0:24:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would agree to such\Nan outlandish request?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The video transponder snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.84,0:24:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,People of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.94,0:24:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.12,0:24:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll settle this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.52,0:24:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is rather sudden, and it must\Nseem quite odd, but please hear my plea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.14,0:25:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to borrow all of your money,\Nand I need to do so immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.74,0:25:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It is with great regret that I cannot\Noffer you a reason for this request.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.40,0:25:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The king is begging? King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.11,0:25:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It came out of nowhere, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.84,0:25:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your head. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to show some\Ndignity as our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.88,0:25:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.04,0:25:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the history books.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.64,0:25:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Every descendant of yours will be\Nashamed of this crowd's indignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oblating yourself, you'll\Nturn us into a laughingstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, do you think this is a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.02,0:25:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I would sacrifice anything for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.54,0:25:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.15,0:25:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd chop off my arms and legs, if that's\Nwhat it would take to keep my kingdom safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.30,0:25:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If things go wrong tonight, I'll\Nbear the burden and kill Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.32,0:26:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.50,0:26:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.22,0:26:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He put his faith, his life, in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.90,0:26:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is everyone waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.48,0:26:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get that money! Yeah, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.22,0:26:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The king's a good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If he needs our help that badly,\Nwe don't need to question why.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he must have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.22,0:26:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, bring out your money! No, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.90,0:26:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, your virtue may save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:26:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.12,0:27:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.74,0:27:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.40,0:27:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this nation\Nshare the same kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.84,0:27:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the Rick family has shown\Nthem for eight centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.60,0:27:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wonderful kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.08,0:27:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely it can be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.44,0:27:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.64,0:27:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry back to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.76,0:27:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope this is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.43,0:27:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the king went to...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.42,0:27:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sivio!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on the screen right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.51,0:27:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to come\Nall this way! We got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.66,0:27:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's happening,\Nbut we're all here to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.36,0:27:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We trust you completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.06,0:27:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.08,0:28:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.62,0:28:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.64,0:28:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.10,0:28:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, please wait!\NWhat are you doing? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.48,0:28:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me, or\NI'm going to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.28,0:28:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.46,0:28:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.00,0:28:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.36,0:28:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.96,0:28:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.44,0:28:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a naughty king you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.46,0:28:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The knights steal young soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.58,0:29:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there gawking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.44,0:29:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you join the dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.26,0:29:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Parasite string!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.00,0:29:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the soldiers are\Ncutting people down too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.74,0:29:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.05,0:29:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.97,0:29:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.10,0:29:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He was such a kind man before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.32,0:29:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something\Nwe've done to anger you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.94,0:29:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I possibly say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can justify this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.96,0:29:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell right into Doflamingo's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The king's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No more, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.74,0:29:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, can we do it\Nalready, please? Go-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.00,0:29:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.70,0:29:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't rush things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.22,0:29:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I need them trembling with\Nfear in the depths of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.74,0:30:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And when this kingdom hates\NKing Rick with all its heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.84,0:30:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when the heroes\Ncan appear! I'm here.
